corpus/documents/emails/mun_b_newsletter_market_d245.md:1:United Egg Producers — Winter Market Bulletin
corpus/documents/emails/mun_b_newsletter_market_d245.md:2:
corpus/documents/emails/mun_b_newsletter_market_d245.md:3:Wholesale shell-egg prices held firm through the holiday pull and into January, with breaking stock also elevated. Cold-storage inventories remain below the five-year average. Grain markets were mixed; corn firmed on export demand while soybean meal eased slightly.
corpus/documents/emails/mun_b_newsletter_market_d245.md:4:
corpus/documents/emails/mun_b_newsletter_market_d245.md:5:Association notes: the winter membership webinar on farm energy management is now on the calendar for late February — registration link inside. Reminder that annual membership dues renew this quarter.
