corpus/documents/emails/mun_a_newsletter_d63.md:1:United Egg — Weekly Market Bulletin
corpus/documents/emails/mun_a_newsletter_d63.md:2:
corpus/documents/emails/mun_a_newsletter_d63.md:3:Midwest large shell-egg prices held mostly steady this week on light demand as the summer lull continues; breaking-stock demand was firm. Feed costs eased slightly on improved corn crop conditions across the belt. Retail features were quiet ahead of the back-to-school pull.
corpus/documents/emails/mun_a_newsletter_d63.md:4:
corpus/documents/emails/mun_a_newsletter_d63.md:5:Association note: the annual industry field day registration is now open; details and agenda on the members' site. Routine assessment filings for the quarter are due end of month as usual.
